WEBVTT

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:45.160
Beach volleyball tournament
 Mixed Teams    Great Prizes!

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.240
It's already time for the beach
volleyball tournament again.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.800
I want the 3D TV!

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:40.590
It's a gamer's dream to be
able to play games in 3D!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:42.980
What the squid is a 3D TV?

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.160
Well, you see the picture in 3D.

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:47.160
3D?

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.330
Wow! The 3D TV is squidly mine!

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.920
If we're going to do this,
we're going for gold.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.010
Squid Girl

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.010
Aizawa Eiko

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.730
Squid for the win!

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:58.470
Okay!

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:03.470
<b>You feeling lucky, squid?</b>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.140
18th Annual Beach Volleyball
Tournament

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.730
A Squid Girl chasing team?

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.250
As promised, if we win, you
have to come to my lab.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.330
I never squidding promised that!

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.360
I am going to win the 3D TV.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.350
Then...

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.110
It's against the rules to have
3 people on the team.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.720
Since we graduated from
MIT top of the class,

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:28.540
there is nothing

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.530
we can't do!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.610
It's the new version.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.130
It's sadder than the
previous version.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.710
If it was surfing, I wouldn't
be worried...

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.680
This is my first time playing
volleyball, too.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.180
I won't lose to an invader!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:46.520
If we win, you can have the 3D TV.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.880
Don't think that saving
lives is easy.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.100
The beach is our home ground.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.870
Chizuru, you're not playing?

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:58.320
I'm everybody's manager.
So, good luck!

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.780
We are now ready to start the
volleyball tournament!

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.160
That's cheating! You can't
use your tentacles!

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.840
My tentacles are part of my body.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.500
You can use any part of
your body to receive.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:18.560
You're so lame for going
all out against kids.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.380
I guess you two really
want the 3D TV...

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.540
Yay! We did it!

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.180
Squid Girl
Eiko

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.180
Takeru
Yuuta

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:25.180
Go, Squid Girl!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:25.890
Take this!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.000
I got it!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.310
Bring it!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.740
Do it... more...

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.190
Squid Girl
Eiko

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.190
Cindy
Sanae

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.190
Stay there and stay dead!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.940
Try receiving the serve
of the top of MIT!

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.030
What's MIT got to do with this?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.370
I bet they are going to use some
squidly weird tools again.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.720
This is a completely
indestructible ball.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.140
It's impossible to hit this ball back.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.080
Your tentacles will
be torn to shreds.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:57.140
Yes, we can!

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:02.010
Squid Girl
Eiko

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.160
Mommy!

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:00.230
I'll be back!

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:02.010
I shall return!

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.760
Squiddie, go easy on us.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.910
Oh man, it's hard to spike
my best friend.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:08.760
Best friend?

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.670
Who are you?

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.440
Oh no, maybe they'll gang
up on me and...

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.550
Squid Girl
Eiko

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.550
Nagisa
Kiyomi

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:17.570
NOOOO!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.570
Nagisa, wait!

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.820
Hey, shooting toothpicks
is against the rules!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.950
This time the theme is
"Attentive Squid Girl."

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:32.170
The tentacles can dispense
warm and cold towels.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.540
The mouth can shoot chili oil.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.540
That does sound useful
for serving people,

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.920
but here it's useless!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:52.980
Squid Girl
Eiko

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:52.980
South
 Wind

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.410
Hey, wait!

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:52.980
I guess she's still not
over her shyness.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.720
We've finally arrived at the
climax of this tournament!

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.940
The final match is between 
Lemon House at the Sea and the lifeguards!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.250
Gorou!

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:03.900
Got it!

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:12.540
It's not very manly to
hit a girl on purpose!

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:16.460
If you're going to use tentacles,
we won't hold back either.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.790
Besides, there are no
genders in a match!

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:19.670
Gorou.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.130
Chizuru...

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.340
I thought "there are no
genders in a match"?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.180
Damn!

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:38.150
Squid Girl
Eiko

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:38.150
Gorou
Isozaki

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.360
<b>Squid Girl
Eiko</b>

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.360
<b>Gorou
Isozaki</b>

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:42.880
This is the 10th match point! 
Will this one result in a win?!

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:45.280
The 3D TV is squidding ours.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.360
Not so fast!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.410
Here it comes!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.360
Y-you are...

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.180
No-men Rider Hannya!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.260
No, Eiko.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.130
T-that was you?

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:09.970
What are you babbling about?!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:10.760
Gorou!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.510
This is it!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.310
Squid Girl, up high!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.040
Got it.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:19.390
Here I come.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.050
The ball... exploded...

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.840
<b>Squid Girl
Eiko</b>

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.840
<b>Gorou
Isozaki</b>

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.840
The winner is Team Lemon!

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.320
We did it!

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:55.810
Good for you, Squid Girl.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.540
Are you...

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.370
I'm Eiko.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:04.270
Huh?

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.310
I can't squidly eat it.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:07.600
Freaking duh!

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.750
A large portion of fried
noodles, please.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:11.540
Snow cone with sweet
milk, please.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.860
Yokohama ramen and
steamed dumplings.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.830
The cutlet curry and baby
anchovies on rice are done.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.790
I'll take those out right away!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.750
Man, it's packed...

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.170
Hi, Gorou!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.080
Oh, sorry Gorou, can you
come back later?

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:29.090
<b>Quite the
squidicament we're in.</b>

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.380
Man, I'm bushed.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.070
It's quite late, but let's have lunch.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.310
Squid Girl, Nagisa, can
you take these?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:39.820
Sure.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:41.460
Got it...

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.870
What are you doing?

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:49.230
Huh?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.510
Squid Girlie, what's wrong?

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.580
My tentacles won't move.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.960
But they were moving
just a moment ago!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.290
I wonder what's wrong.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.060
Did they run out of batteries?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.880
They aren't battery powered!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.960
Maybe they're tired because you
were working so hard until now.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.530
Do they feel tired or heavy?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.180
They do feel tired and heavy...

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.390
It might be something
like a cramp.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.640
How's that?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.580
I don't feel anything.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:23.980
Let's have some shrimp!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.600
They'll be better after
you eat something.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:27.630
How is it?

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.800
Shrimp are always yummy!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.530
No, I mean your tentacles.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:37.530
How about the old tradition
of bathing in the ocean?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.360
In old times, people
got into the ocean

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.490
because they believed it had
medicinal properties.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.130
How is it?

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.040
I guess it's time for this method.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:54.130
Hey, it's me. 
Listen, can you do me a fav-

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.420
Squiddie!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:00.470
This is what they call shock therapy.
 Even Squid Girl won't stand Sanae's-

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.900
Squid Girlie, the flappy
things! Remember?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.080
Oh, right on!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.570
Flappy won't work either, huh?

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:20.510
1.2 lux. About the same
brightness as the moon.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.640
She was easily reaching
40000 lux before.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.870
So her firefly squid powers
don't work either.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.360
Could this be considered devolution?

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.120
This might be devolution.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.460
From the perspective of a top MIT graduate,
I think it's devolution.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:33.880
Devolution?

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:37.680
It means that in order to adapt to 
her new life and environment on land,

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.050
she's losing unnecessary functions.

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:43.700
I guess you can just hit someone with your
hand instead of the flappy things.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:46.810
You can use electric light instead
of bioluminescence.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.390
And you can use your hands
instead of your tentacles.

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.440
It's not that squidding simple!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:56.030
Speaking of which, without your squid powers, 
you'll be nothing but an annoying brat.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:58.060
That's horrible!

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.530
Yeah, that's horrible!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:03.560
Even without her squid powers, 
Squiddie has a wonderful affiliation!

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.540
Affiliation?

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.190
A cute girl who's cosplaying
as a squid...

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.750
That's way too niche!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.740
How about a cute girl cosplaying
as a Squidian?

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.000
You too?!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.570
I can still spit ink!

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.140
It's no good.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.230
The flavor, aroma, and quantity are deficient.
 I can't serve this.

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:34.120
But it's really strange that this devolution
happened so rapidly.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.320
No worries.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.840
We will get to the bottom of it!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.530
Hey!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:54.500
I won't be able to squid-vade
with this body...

00:10:56.450 --> 00:11:01.640
The question is, do I withdraw,
 or do I stay here?

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:06.600
Is it better to retreat for now and
 wait for a better opportunity?

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:13.130
Even if it can't be shown on a map,

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.390
from an emotional standpoint,

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:18.440
I already conquered this
area a long time ago.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:23.300
If they say that they want
me to stay here,

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.950
I have no reason to say no.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:29.620
If I stay here, I don't think I
will be able to get better.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.580
I'm thinking about returning
to the sea for a while.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.440
No, you can't do that!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:38.230
Yeah, you're part of
our family now!

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.170
Please don't go, we'll do
whatever you want!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:44.990
Oh, all right, if you say so...

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:48.730
That's for the best.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.370
Yeah, I don't think it'll
get better here.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.480
It'll be quiet without you.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.100
It's for your sake.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.110
I don't have the right or qualification
to stop you.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.320
I won't forget about you.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.070
Write me, okay?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:04.430
See you again.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.320
Good luck!

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:11.790
Well, I'm really going back
to my squid home then...

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.310
Take care.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.420
Take care.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.290
If you are drowning, don't panic.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.880
Will Squid Girlie be okay?

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:33.850
Yes...

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.750
She'll be back in no time anyway.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.740
She does get lonely quickly.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.410
Yeah, she does.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.240
It's so cute that she's
being so headstrong.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:48.490
Now, shall we make tonight's dinner
her favorite shrimp curry?

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.370
Squid Girlie is going to love that!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:54.370
Hey, Squid Girl, how long do
you plan on showing off?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.490
Squiddie!

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:58.740
Squid Girl!
Squiddie!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.470
Welcome to Yuigahama Beach
Always take home your trash

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:54.430
An even worse squidicament!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.390
It's been quite a while since then.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:02.290
This place has become
totally normal.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.150
It's always been a normal place.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.740
Well, I won't deny that
it's gotten quiet.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:12.740
I wonder how she's doing.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.890
I hope she's doing well.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:22.670
I can't believe she really
went home...

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.060
I am claiming this house as a base
to take over the squidly surface-

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:40.730
no- the whole universe!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.020
You... Squid Girl!

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:45.860
Squid Girlie!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:46.570
Squiddie!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:50.420
Don't make us worry like that! Where have you been?!

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:49.970
Squid Girl! We missed you!

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.600
You had me so worried, Squid Girlie!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.780
The surface world and the human
race are too small for me.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:03.130
I am going to become
the ruler of the universe!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:10.200
Fantastic! You're going to take the first
step to becoming extra-terrestrial life!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:14.570
No matter how you change, 
I will be on your side!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.150
Um, those...

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.140
Squid Girlie, where
are your tentacles?

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:22.970
They weren't tentacles anymore.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:26.650
Since they were like human hair, 
I don't sq- need them anymore.

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.140
You cut them off yourself?

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:32.700
Since they were not working, 
they didn't grow back.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.200
Are you sure about that?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.580
And the way you're talking
is super un-natural.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.480
What part is odd?

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:45.160
I might be Squid Girl,
 but I am Squid Girl Mk-II.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:48.960
This stopped
the squidly speech.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.260
You don't have to force
it, you know?

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.970
I am not forcing it.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:59.720
In any case, I am really
glad Squid Girl is back.

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:04.300
Even if she can't use her
tentacles or spit ink.

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:05.270
Of course.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:09.820
I can make it even without
my tentacles!

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:18.800
Thank you.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:19.200
No problem.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:32.010
Squid Girl, these all need
to go to table 4.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.090
Of course.

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:39.760
You've...

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.210
you've totally gotten used
to using your hands.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:48.010
Yeah...

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:48.910
Wrong.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:50.490
This is...

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.190
wrong!

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.620
Takeru, what are you
talking about?

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.070
Squid Girlie isn't like this!

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.780
She's more energetic and
has a big mouth.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:02.330
She keeps screwing up,
 but doesn't let that get her down.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:07.040
This Squid Girlie isn't
Squid Girlie at all!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:08.770
Eek!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.250
Takeru!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.980
I'm sorry.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.590
I'm sorry, too.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:41.120
I feel like I'm just getting worse.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.290
I don't think that's true.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.370
Who are you?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:53.630
Sorry for talking to you out
of the blue. May I sit?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:02.200
Did you come to conquer
the surface world?

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.500
That's squidly right!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:06.770
I am squidly going to punish the evil 
humans who pollute the ocean!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:11.950
But my squid powers disappeared

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.780
and I don't know what to do...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.900
Evil humans...

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:22.260
After you actually met humans,

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.420
you met good humans
as well, right?

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:32.030
You say you don't know what to do, 
but that's not true.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:35.960
The important thing is that you do

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:39.160
what you want to do.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.980
What I want to do?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.930
You'll be fine.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.310
I think you should simply do
what you think is right.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:53.830
Hey, Squid Girl. 
Let's go swimming!

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.960
Oh, it's time for me to go.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.310
S-sure...

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.350
Oh, by the way.

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:06.450
You're not alone.

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:08.540
Keep that in mind.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.220
Do you know her?

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.610
No, I just squidly met her.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.960
Yeah, that's better.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.720
The squid talk.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.560
It throws me off when you try
to pull that normal talk.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.090
The ocean is the only unexplored
frontier of this planet.

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:36.430
That's where the secret about the birth
of extra-terrestrial life is hidden!

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:39.920
Yes! I don't believe that 
Squid Girl is the last one!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.910
There's a chance that there is a Giant Squid Girl, 
an Octopus Girl, or a Jellyfish Girl!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.490
Or even a Dragon-God's Servant Girl!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.950
Here we go!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.920
You're not alone.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.910
This is weird...

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:06.350
What happened?

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.120
Squid Girl, get aw-!

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:16.110
Eiko!

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.210
Eiko!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:01.530
You...

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:04.990
Squid Girl is back.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.870
That was your doing, wasn't it!

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:16.040
Help! Help me!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.460
Mommy!

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:28.640
We're sorry, we're really sorry!

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.760
What should we do? Forgive them?

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.180
I guess you could say that I
got my squid powers back

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:38.600
because Eiko almost drowned.

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:42.400
You heard her. I guess we
have to forgive you.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:47.480
Thank you! Thank you so much!

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:55.080
I look forward to staying
with you again.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:06.320
If I start to feel bad again,

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.720
I'll just toss you into
the squidly ocean.

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:12.760
In the end, this just shows that

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.490
I'm the universal existence that
can control not only the ocean,

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:16.630
but also the surface world!

00:22:19.340 --> 00:22:21.590
Don't be so cocky!

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:22.550
Ow!
